    timeout_secs: 10


| Flag                 | Description                                                      | Default          |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| `[QUERY]`            | Fuzzy search on document title and key                           | none (lists all) |
| `--roots`            | Only show root documents (no parents)                            | false            |
| `--refs-to <KEY>`    | Documents that reference this key (direct, includes inline)      | none             |
| `--refs-from <KEY>`  | Documents referenced by this key (direct, includes inline)       | none             |
| `--in <KEY[:DEPTH]>` | **Experimental.** Sub-documents of EVERY listed key (AND). Repeatable. | none       |
| `--count`            | Print only the number of matching documents                      | false            |
| `--in-any <KEY...>`  | **Experimental.** Sub-documents of AT LEAST ONE listed key (OR). Repeatable. | none |
| `--not-in <KEY...>`  | **Experimental.** Exclude sub-documents of any listed key (NOT). Repeatable. | none |
| `--max-depth <N>`    | **Experimental.** Default depth for `--in` / `--in-any` / `--not-in`. Unbounded if omitted. | none |
| `-l, --limit <N>`    | Maximum number of results                                        | 50               |
iwe find api --roots

# Limit results
iwe find --limit 10

# Get JSON for programmatic use
iwe find -f json

# Get keys for piping
# Count matching documents
 iwe find --roots --count

iwe find --roots -f keys

# Pipe keys to retrieve command
iwe find --roots -f keys | head -5 | xargs -I {} iwe retrieve -k {}
```
